        <mxCell id="b54" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1F3A5F;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;shadow=1;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Data volume &amp;mdash; verified, not estimated&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:11px;border-collapse:collapse&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;TRANSACTIONS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;13,305,915&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;48.7%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;FRAUD_LABELS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8,914,963&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;32.6%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;AML_TRANSACTIONS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5,078,345&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;18.6%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;CARDS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;6,146&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;0.02%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;CUSTOMERS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;2,000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;0.01%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;MCC_CODES&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;109&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;0.01%&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #999999&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Total, 6 tables&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #999999&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;27,307,478&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #999999&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;100%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fraud labels&lt;/b&gt; &amp;mdash; Yes 13,332 (0.15%) / No 8,901,631. That is 8,914,963 label rows against 13,305,915 transactions, 67.0% by row count. The shortfall is by design, not a load failure. With no FK, the match itself is unverified &amp;mdash; the anti-join belongs in silver.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;WM &amp;mdash; LAST_UPDATED_TS&lt;/b&gt; is on every table: &lt;i&gt;GENERATED ALWAYS FOR EACH ROW ON UPDATE AS ROW CHANGE TIMESTAMP&lt;/i&gt;. Engine-maintained, verified on 13.3 M rows, and the column an incremental read watermarks on. Two caveats: it does not capture DELETEs, and Fabric&amp;#39;s incremental Db2 read fails in this tenant &amp;mdash; the demo lands full snapshots.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Provenance&lt;/b&gt; &amp;mdash; counts verified in Db2 by &lt;i&gt;scripts/05_verify.sh&lt;/i&gt; (23/23) and against the Fabric bronze landing by &lt;i&gt;scripts/17_verify_bronze.py&lt;/i&gt; (77/77), control totals tying exactly.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="495" width="400" x="40" y="730" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b55" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Relative volume&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666&quot;&gt; &amp;mdash; linear against 13.3 M; the smallest bar is padded to a 3 px minimum&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
